WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.273 --> 00:00:06.554
BUCKY BARNES
The world...

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:12.411
is upside down.

00:00:18.472 --> 00:00:20.739
People need something
to get behind.

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:24.374
SAM WILSON
Well, let's get to work.

00:00:31.508 --> 00:00:32.883
BUCKY BARNES
So, we're partners?

00:00:36.079 --> 00:00:37.612
SAM WILSON
Co-workers.

00:00:40.045 --> 00:00:41.279
BUCKY BARNES
Not necessarily a team.

00:00:41.279 --> 00:00:42.346
SAM WILSON
Nah.

00:00:47.053 --> 00:00:48.475
BUCKY BARNES
I thought we were gonna go left!

00:00:48.475 --> 00:00:49.279
SAM WILSON
You went the wrong way!

00:00:49.279 --> 00:00:50.311
BUCKY BARNES
I was clearing the way!

00:00:50.311 --> 00:00:51.539
SAM WILSON
I came out first,

00:00:51.539 --> 00:00:52.805
you were supposed to follow me!

00:00:52.805 --> 00:00:55.179
It's in every action movie!

